cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "道教經典白話翻譯集 / Daoist Canon Vernacular Translation Dataset"
type: dataset
version: v0.1
date-released: 2026-06-02
license: CC0-1.0
url: "https://lius.cc/canon"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lius-cc/daoism-canon"
abstract: >-
  1,275 Daoist scriptures (17,081 chapters), each in three parallel columns:
  original classical Chinese text (public domain), modern vernacular translation,
  and scholarly annotation. The vernacular translations, prefaces, and annotations
  are original works by Dingren Daoxue Academy, released under CC0 1.0. v0.1 is a
  pre-peer-review, preprint-style release.
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Chi-Ying
    affiliation: "Dingren Daoxue Academy, Liu-Cuo Pai Dingxin Men"
keywords:
  - Daoism
  - Taoist canon
  - Daozang
  - vernacular translation
  - Chinese religion
  - digital humanities
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20507890"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.20507890"
    description: "Concept DOI (cites all versions)"
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.20248697"
    description: "Related: Daoism-Qwen3.5-9B (open Daoist LLM) which references this corpus"
